                            <comment id="17035917" author="zjffdu" created="Thu, 13 Feb 2020 04:57:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Make sense to replace newline character or tab with white space. BTW, what interpreters do you use ?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17035986" author="nephtyws" created="Thu, 13 Feb 2020 07:28:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=zjffdu&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;zjffdu&quot;&gt;zjffdu&lt;/a&gt;&#160;I use &lt;b&gt;spark.sql&lt;/b&gt;. Also here is an example query to works fine (I&apos;ve used translate function to replace newline character):&lt;br/&gt;
 &lt;em&gt;SELECT id, category, draft_step, status, name_ko, name_en, name_ja, translate(description_ko, &#8216;\\\n&#8217;, &apos; &#8217;) AS description FROM {table}&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17036106" author="zjffdu" created="Thu, 13 Feb 2020 10:16:48 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=nephtyws&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;nephtyws&quot;&gt;nephtyws&lt;/a&gt;&#160;I have created one PR for this, could you help to verify it ? Thanks&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
